@AlgorithmClipMaster hopefully not and ultimately that comes down to the failsafes, not to mention the simple easy one that everyone forgets.

All these AI that may or may not have the potential to become sentient (no idea how close or far from this we are) require massive server farms and massive energy consumption, deny the energy to these server farms and the AI losses a lot of its processing potential, maybe even giving us time to find a solution.

Though hopefully we never have to find out about this the hard way.

